  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 407 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D17"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the heparin sodium shortage on 2017-11-14 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E91", "D33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 2618677) is a registered plant on our labels and received an OAI classification from an inspection that ended 2016-10-03, 407 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E24", "D17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) is also a registered plant on our labels and received an OAI classification from an inspection that ended 2016-06-08, 524 days before the posting, and a Warning Letter on 2017-02-14, 273 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["E79", "D16", "D18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1025114) is a registered plant on our labels and received an OAI classification from an inspection that ended 2016-02-26, 627 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["E24", "D15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1416980) is a registered plant on our labels and received an OAI classification from an inspection that ended 2024-08-01 and another that ended 2026-04-02, both after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E34", "E29", "E31"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from BE Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D34"]
    }
  ]
}
